---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Kontakt
description: Sprechen Sie mit uns über den nächsten sinnvollen Schritt Ihrer Organisation in Richtung regeneratives Wirtschaften.
---
<header class="page-head wrap">
  <span class="label">Kontakt</span>
  <h1 class="display">Lassen Sie uns <em>sprechen.</em></h1>
  <p class="lead">Ob Workshop, Training, Beratung oder Feedback zum Kartenset – schreiben Sie uns. Wir melden uns in der Regel innerhalb weniger Tage.</p>
</header>
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="side">
      <span class="label">Direkt</span>
      <p style="margin-top:1rem"><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
      <p><a href="{{ site.linkedin }}" rel="noopener">LinkedIn ↗</a></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      {%- if site.contactFormAction %}
      <form action="{{ site.contactFormAction }}" method="post" style="max-width:44rem">
        <div class="field"><label class="label" for="c-name">Name</label><input id="c-name" type="text" name="name" required autocomplete="name"></div>
        <div class="field"><label class="label" for="c-mail">E-Mail-Adresse</label><input id="c-mail" type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email"></div>
        <div class="field"><label class="label" for="c-sub">Betreff</label><input id="c-sub" type="text" name="_subject"></div>
        <div class="field"><label class="label" for="c-msg">Nachricht</label><textarea id="c-msg" name="message" required></textarea></div>
        <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" required> <span>Ich habe die <a href="/datenschutz/">Datenschutzerklärung</a> zur Kenntnis genommen.</span></label>
        <div class="btns"><button class="btn btn--solid" type="submit">Nachricht senden</button></div>
      </form>
      {%- else %}
      <h2 class="h2" style="max-width:18ch">Am schnellsten per <em>E-Mail.</em></h2>
      <div class="btns">
        <a class="btn btn--solid" href="{{ 'Anfrage über die Website' | mailto(site.email) }}">E-Mail schreiben</a>
        <a class="btn" href="{{ 'Feedback zum Kartenset' | mailto(site.email) }}">Feedback zum Kartenset</a>
      </div>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
